{"status":"success","data":[{"site":{"siteid":13481,"sitename":"Over Kobbkrokvatnet","sitedescription":"Glacial origin lake lying within the Risvik sub-stage ice limit and just outside the Outer Porsanger moraine that runs along the ridge to the south of the lake. Site is located in tundra with are dwarf-shrub communities dominated by Empetrum nigrum ssp. hermaphroditum, with Vaccinium vitis-idaea, V. uliginosum, V. myrtillus, and Betula nana as frequent and locally co-dominant components. The local bedrock is mostly dark grey sandstone, alternating with layers of grey-black mudstone and shale, assigned to the Barents Sea group and marginal to the rocks of the Caledonian orogeny.","sitenotes":null,"geography":"{\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"crs\":{\"type\":\"name\",\"properties\":{\"name\":\"EPSG:4326\"}},\"coordinates\":[[[29.29295,70.6989],[29.29736,70.6989],[29.29736,70.70018],[29.29295,70.70018],[29.29295,70.6989]]]}","altitude":47,"collectionunitid":15103,"collectionunit":null,"handle":"KOBBKROK","unittype":"Core","datasets":[{"doi":[],"agerange":[],"database":"European Pollen Database","datasetid":20290,"datasetpi":[{"initials":"A.J.","contactid":8862,"firstname":"Antony J.","familyname":"Long","contactname":"Long, Antony J."},{"initials":"B.","contactid":602,"firstname":"Brian","familyname":"Huntley","contactname":"Huntley, Brian"},{"initials":"J.R.M.","contactid":601,"firstname":"Judy R. M.","familyname":"Allen","contactname":"Allen, Judy R. M."}],"datasettype":"geochronologic","datasetnotes":null,"recdatecreated":"2016-08-11T06:10:29"},{"doi":["10.21233/jaj6-2125"],"agerange":[],"database":"European Plant Macrofossil Database","datasetid":20291,"datasetpi":[{"initials":"A.J.","contactid":8862,"firstname":"Antony J.","familyname":"Long","contactname":"Long, Antony J."},{"initials":"B.","contactid":602,"firstname":"Brian","familyname":"Huntley","contactname":"Huntley, Brian"},{"initials":"J.R.M.","contactid":601,"firstname":"Judy R. M.","familyname":"Allen","contact